      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אֲמַר לֵיהּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Kahana This name is ambiguous; click to compare candidates\" data-full-name=\"Rav Kahana\" data-name-he=\"רַב כָּהֲנָא\" data-ambiguous-key=\"rav-kahana-ambiguous\" data-ambiguous-name-he=\"רַב כָּהֲנָא\" data-ambiguous-name-en=\"Rav Kahana\" data-ambiguous-candidate-ids=\"2003,2004,2005,2006,2007\">רַב כָּהֲנָא</span><span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"0\" data-marker-letter=\"א\">א</span>: אִילּוּ הָדַר קָנֵי, מִי לָא שָׁקְלָא? וְכֵיוָן",
