      "width": "450px",
      "text": "סְבַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Ravina This name is ambiguous; click to compare candidates\" data-full-name=\"Ravina\" data-name-he=\"רָבִינָא\" data-ambiguous-key=\"ravina-ambiguous\" data-ambiguous-name-he=\"רָבִינָא\" data-ambiguous-name-en=\"Ravina\" data-ambiguous-candidate-ids=\"2646,2647\">רָבִינָא</span> לְמֵימַר: לֵית לַהּ אֶלָּא חַד דִּיקְלָא. אֲמַר לֵיהּ",
