      "width": "450px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yeimar, sixth and seventh-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1804\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yeimar\" data-name-he=\"רב יימר\">רַב יֵימַר</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Ravina This name is ambiguous; click to compare candidates\" data-full-name=\"Ravina\" data-name-he=\"רָבִינָא\" data-ambiguous-key=\"ravina-ambiguous\" data-ambiguous-name-he=\"רָבִינָא\" data-ambiguous-name-en=\"Ravina\" data-ambiguous-candidate-ids=\"2646,2647\">לְרָבִינָא</span>: אִי לֵית לַהּ, חַד דִּיקְלָא נָמֵי לֵית לַהּ!",
