    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "נוֹטְלָן מִשּׁוּם מַתָּנָה. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"3\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אֲמַר לֵיהּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Naḥman bar Ya’akov, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2285\" data-full-name=\"Rav Naḥman bar Ya’akov\" data-name-he=\"רב נחמן בר יעקב\">רַב נַחְמָן</span>: גַּנָּבָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "גַּנּוֹבֵי לְמָה לָךְ? אִי סְבִירָא לָךְ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka, fourth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1577\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוחנן בן ברוקא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-6677\">כְּרַבִּי יוֹחָנָן בֶּן</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka, fourth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1577\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוחנן בן ברוקא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-6677\">בְּרוֹקָה</span>, אֵימָא: ״הֲלָכָה <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka, fourth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1577\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוחנן בן ברוקא\">כְּרַבִּי יוֹחָנָן בֶּן בְּרוֹקָה</span>״ – דְּהָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "שְׁמַעְתְּתָיךְ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka, fourth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1577\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוחנן בן ברוקא\">כְּרַבִּי יוֹחָנָן בֶּן בְּרוֹקָה</span> הוּא דְּאָזְלָא! <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"4\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>דִּלְמָא",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "כִּי הָא קָאָמְרַתְּ – דְּהָהוּא דַּהֲוָה קָא שָׁכֵיב, וַאֲמַרוּ לֵיהּ:",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "נִכְסֵיהּ לְמַאן, דִּלְמָא לִפְלָנְיָא? וַאֲמַר לְהוּ: אֶלָּא לְמַאן?",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "וַאֲמַרְתְּ לַן עֲלַהּ: אִם רָאוּי לְיוֹרְשׁוֹ – נוֹטְלָן מִשּׁוּם יְרוּשָּׁה,",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "וְאִם לָאו – נוֹטְלָן מִשּׁוּם מַתָּנָה. אָמַר לֵיהּ: אִין, <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"4\" data-marker-letter=\"ה\">ה</span>הָכִי",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "קָאָמֵינָא. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"5\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>לְמַאי הִלְכְתָא? סָבַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Adda bar Ahava I, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"194\" data-full-name=\"Rav Adda bar Ahava I\" data-name-he=\"רב אדא בר אהבה\">רַב אַדָּא בַּר אַהֲבָה</span> קַמֵּיהּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rava, fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2582\" data-full-name=\"Rava\" data-name-he=\"רָבָא\">דְּרָבָא</span> לְמֵימַר: אִם רָאוּי לְיוֹרְשׁוֹ – אַלְמְנָתוֹ נִזּוֹנֶית מִנְּכָסָיו,",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "וְאִם לָאו – אֵין אַלְמְנָתוֹ נִזּוֹנֶית מִנְּכָסָיו. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"6\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אֲמַר לֵיהּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rava, fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2582\" data-full-name=\"Rava\" data-name-he=\"רָבָא\">רָבָא</span>:",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "מִיגְרָע <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"5\" data-marker-letter=\"ו\">ו</span>גָּרְעָא?! הַשְׁתָּא בִּירוּשָׁה – דְּאוֹרָיְיתָא, אָמְרַתְּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "אַלְמְנָתוֹ נִזּוֹנֶית מִנְּכָסָיו; בְּמַתָּנָה – דְּרַבָּנַן, לֹא כׇּל שֶׁכֵּן?!",
      "segment_ids": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"7\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אֶלָּא אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rava, fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2582\" data-full-name=\"Rava\" data-name-he=\"רָבָא\">רָבָא</span><span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"6\" data-marker-letter=\"ז\">ז</span>, כְּדִשְׁלַח <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Aḥa bar Rav Avira, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"291\" data-full-name=\"Rav Aḥa bar Rav Avira\" data-name-he=\"רב אחא בר רב עוירא\">רַב אַחָא בַּר רַב עַוְיָא</span>:",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "לְדִבְרֵי <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka, fourth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"1577\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yoḥanan ben Beroka\" data-name-he=\"רבי יוחנן בן ברוקא\">רַבִּי יוֹחָנָן בֶּן בְּרוֹקָה</span>, ״נְכָסַי לְךָ, וְאַחֲרֶיךָ לִפְלוֹנִי״,",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "אִם הָיָה רִאשׁוֹן רָאוּי לְיוֹרְשׁוֹ – אֵין לַשֵּׁנִי בִּמְקוֹם רִאשׁוֹן",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "כְּלוּם; שֶׁאֵין לְשׁוֹן מַתָּנָה אֶלָּא לְשׁוֹן יְרוּשָּׁה, וִירוּשָּׁה",
      "segment_ids": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "480px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "אֵין לָהּ הֶפְסֵק. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"8\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אֲמַר לֵיהּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rava, fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2582\" data-full-name=\"Rava\" data-name-he=\"רָבָא\">רָבָא</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Naḥman bar Ya’akov, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2285\" data-full-name=\"Rav Naḥman bar Ya’akov\" data-name-he=\"רב נחמן בר יעקב\">לְרַב נַחְמָן</span>: וְהָא אַפְסְקַהּ!",
      "segment_ids": [
        8
      ]
    },
